# Chāyārūpasaṃyojanassa visesā.
photo_merge_advanced.projective = Dassanakoṇasamīkaraṇaṃ (parivattanena saddhiṃ)
photo_merge_advanced.cylindrical = Nāḷākāraṃ vitthatarūpaṃ
photo_merge_advanced.deghost = Calantavatthūnaṃ dvirūpāni apanetha (paṭhamaṃ chāyācittaṃ pamāṇaṃ)
photo_merge_advanced.focal = Fokala-dūraṃ (px) / rūpassa vitthāro (px)
photo_merge_advanced.masks = Fokusa-saṃyojanassa phalaṃ sampādetabbāni santharapaṭicchādakāni payojeti. Santharesu paṭicchādakaṃ uccinatha, tato ālikhitvā sodhetha.
photo_merge_advanced.no_match = Vissāsanīyaṃ samīkaraṇaṃ na laddhaṃ. Bahulakkhaṇāni, bahusādhāraṇaṭṭhānāni, appadassanakoṇabhedāni chāyācittāni payojetha.
photo_merge_advanced.invalid = Mūlachāyācittāni vā saṃyojanaṭṭhapanāni vā ayuttāni.
